      "content": "It makes sense that the usual suggestions feel hollow when the foundation of your life has shifted so drastically. That profound silence you're describing sounds incredibly heavy, like a permanent weight. If the usual support systems haven't worked, maybe it's time to look for a different kind of connection, perhaps with someone who specializes in deep, existential grief. You don't have to carry this quietness alone; there are people who can sit with that emptiness with you.",
